RegularExpression: every form its examples take (area 19, "Changing a standard type's encoding")
encoding 1
column text

example [A-Z]{2}[0-9]{2}
text [A-Z]{2}[0-9]{2}
json "[A-Z]{2}[0-9]{2}"
stored '[A-Z]{2}[0-9]{2}'

example (?i)grey|gray
text (?i)grey|gray
json "(?i)grey|gray"
stored '(?i)grey|gray'

example \p{Lu}\w*
text \p{Lu}\w*
json "\\p{Lu}\\w*"
stored E'\\p{Lu}\\w*'
